# AI-MultiTool-SaaS

A full-stack AI-powered SaaS application that enables users to generate articles, create AI images, remove image backgrounds, review resumes, and access premium features through a subscription-based model.

## Overview

AI-MultiTool-SaaS is a modern SaaS platform built using React, Node.js, PostgreSQL, and AI APIs. The application provides multiple AI-powered tools through a secure and scalable architecture.
